<title>USA: Texaco CEO to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Texaco CEO to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc said Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Peter I. Bijur will hold a press conference at 1630 EST/2130 GMT at the Grand Hyatt Hotel in New York City.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said Bijur will be discussing &quot;EEO (Equal Employment Opportunity) matters&quot; and have &quot;comments on Texaco policy&quot; related to the charges of racial discrimination now being heard in federal district court in White Plains, N.Y.</p>
</text>
